paragraph='Last Friday, I visited a book fair with my aunt. We walked slowly past the stalls and looked at colourful covers. Some visitors were comparing prices, while others were asking sellers about new books. A little boy was showing his mother a picture book. We stopped at a stall with stories for young readers. The seller helped me choose a short story collection. My aunt bought a book about birds. After paying, we put the books in our cloth bag and found a quiet place to sit. I read the first page of my new book before we went home. I enjoyed watching people share their interest in reading.'
